{"schema_version":"1.7.5","id":"GHSA-3hh9-752g-5g22","published":"2026-06-04T18:30:31Z","modified":"2026-07-23T15:11:28.205252734Z","aliases":["CVE-2026-10813","PYSEC-2026-3480"],"summary":"LMCache: 16-bit multimodal hash collision can poison KV cache entries","details":"A flaw has been found in LMCache up to 0.4.6. This affects the function hex_hash_to_int16 of the file lmcache/integration/vllm/utils.py of the component KV Cache Handler. Executing a manipulation can lead to use of weak hash. The attack needs to be launched locally. The attack requires a high level of complexity. It is indicated that the exploitability is difficult. The exploit has been published and may be used. The pull request to fix this issue awaits acceptance.","affected":[{"package":{"name":"lmcache","ecosystem":"PyPI","purl":"pkg:pypi/lmcache"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"last_affected":"0.4.6"}]}],"versions":["0.3.0","0.3.1","0.3.1.post1","0.3.10","0.3.10.post1","0.3.10.post2","0.3.11","0.3.12","0.3.13","0.3.14","0.3.15","0.3.2","0.3.3","0.3.4","0.3.5","0.3.6","0.3.7","0.3.9","0.3.9.post1","0.3.9.post2","0.4.1","0.4.2","0.4.3","0.4.4","0.4.5","0.4.6"],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/main/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/06/GHSA-3hh9-752g-5g22/GHSA-3hh9-752g-5g22.json"}}],"references":[{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-10813"},{"type":"WEB","url":"https://github.com/LMCache/LMCache/issues/3301"},{"type":"WEB","url":"https://github.com/LMCache/LMCache/pull/2932"},{"type":"PACKAGE","url":"https://github.com/LMCache/LMCache"},{"type":"WEB","url":"https://vuldb.com/cve/CVE-2026-10813"},{"type":"WEB","url":"https://vuldb.com/submit/831641"},{"type":"WEB","url":"https://vuldb.com/vuln/368261"},{"type":"WEB","url":"https://vuldb.com/vuln/368261/cti"}],"database_specific":{"cwe_ids":["CWE-327"],"github_reviewed":true,"github_reviewed_at":"2026-07-15T22:10:24Z","nvd_published_at":"2026-06